# The secrets injected into the submitted SDL: the Akash API key (which can close
# a lease, and closing destroys the chain's volumes), the tunnel token, the
# validator mnemonic and the relayer mnemonic. This repository is private, but
# private is not the same as "safe to commit a key to".
.env*
!.env.example

# Personal Claude Code overrides. Holds the permission rule that lets the agent
# run bin/lease-shell.py — a shell into the running validator — without a
# prompt. Not committed: what one operator allows on their own machine is not a
# property of this repository.
.claude/settings.local.json
__pycache__/
